[150.868937, "o", "amazon,Books > Law > Law Specialties > Sports Law,4,Books,Lawn & Garden,kitchen & dining,Sports Collectibles,\r\namazon,Industrial & Scientific > Lab & Scientific Products > Life Science Supplies,3,Business & Industrial,Kitchen & Dining,party supplies,,\r\namazon,Books > History > American History > United States History > U.S. Revolution & Founding History,5,Books,Outdoor Recreation,kitchen & dining,bicycle parts,Embellishments & Trims\r\namazon,\"Grocery & Gourmet Food > Snack Foods > Snack Food Salsas, Dips & Spreads\",3,\"Food, Beverages & Tobacco\",Outdoor Recreation,kitchen & dining,,\r\namazon,Toys & Games > Hobbies > Hobby Remote & App Controlled Vehicles & Parts > Hobby Remote & App Controlled Vehicle Parts > RC Vehicle Bodies & Scale Accessories > RC Vehicle Bodies,6,Toys & Games,Hobbies & Creative Arts,Plumbing Fixture Hardware & Parts,gun parts & accessories,RC Power Plant & Driveline Systems\r\namazon,Books > Science & Math > Biological Sciences > Biology > Developmental Biology,5,Books,Kitchen & Dining,kitchen & dining,bicycle parts,bicycle drivetrain parts\r\namazon,Pet Supplies > Dog Supplies > Dog Grooming Supplies > Dog Shower & Bath Accessories > Professional Dog Bathtubs,5,sporting goods,Household Supplies,party supplies,gun parts & accessories,hunting dog equipment\r\namazon,Office Products > Office & School Supplies > Writing Supplies & Correction Supplies > Pens & Pen Refills > Bottled Pen Ink,5,sporting goods,Office & School Supplies,kitchen & dining,Art & Crafting Materials,\"Craft Paint, Ink & Glaze\"\r\namazon,Industrial & Scientific > Professional Medical Supplies > Surgical Supplies > Wound Closure > Skin Adhesives,5,Business & Industrial,Household Supplies,party supplies,bicycle parts,Skin Care Tools\r\n"]
